<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Consumer Electronics</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Markets we serve</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Consumer electronics and smartphone manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures high-density PCBAs, miniaturized sensor assemblies and wireless charging modules for smartphones, wearables and connected consumer products. High-volume SMT, microelectronics assembly and product-level functional testing are supported within the Hana manufacturing group.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-hero.webp" alt="Consumer electronics sensor assembly" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Wireless chargers</span><span>Remote controls</span><span>Bluetooth audio</span><span>Smart-home hubs</span><span>Wearables</span><span>LED lighting</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow on-dark">Why consumer electronics buyers choose Hana</div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">High-density electronics manufacturing at volume</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Consumer electronics programs combine high component density, compact mechanical formats and demanding production volumes. Hana supports these requirements with high-volume SMT, miniaturized sensor assembly and wireless charging manufacturing, together with acoustic, Bluetooth, wireless and GPS functional test where required. Manufacturing across multiple Hana locations also provides options for additional capacity and supply continuity.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Precision at volume</div><p>Miniaturized sensor assembly and fine-pitch SMT for compact, high-density consumer and smartphone electronics at production volume.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Wireless charging</div><p>Assembly and functional test of wireless charging modules and coils, with acoustic, Bluetooth, wireless and GPS testing available to program requirements.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-country manufacturing</div><p>Consumer electronics manufacturing is supported across Hana sites in Cambodia, China and Thailand, providing options for multi-site qualification, capacity and supply continuity.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c2"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/consumer/smt-sensors"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-card-smt-sensors.webp" alt="Consumer PCBA and packaged sensor assemblies" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</div><p>High-volume SMT and miniaturized sensor assembly for compact consumer electronics, supported by in-line inspection and acoustic, Bluetooth and GPS functional test where required.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/consumer/wireless-charging"><div class="mk-ph"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Wireless charging module on the line &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Wireless Charging</div><p>Wireless charging modules and coil assemblies manufactured through PCBA, final assembly and functional test, alongside other high-volume consumer electronics programs.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2><p class="mk-body">Consumer electronics programs are supported across Hana sites in Cambodia, China and Thailand. High-volume assembly is concentrated in Cambodia, with consumer LED and electronics manufacturing in China and additional PCBA and box-build capability in Thailand. Programs can be qualified across more than one location where capacity or supply continuity requires it. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">remote controls, wireless chargers, home appliances, final assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">consumer LED lighting and modules, EMS assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">EMS / PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from consumer electronics engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for consumer electronics?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures miniaturized sensor assemblies, high-volume SMT boards and wireless charging modules for phones, wearables, remote controls, Bluetooth audio, smart-home hubs, LED lighting and home appliances. Programs can be supplied as PCBAs, subassemblies or complete function-tested products depending on requirements.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana handle high-volume consumer runs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana supports high-volume consumer and smartphone programs with SMT, microelectronics assembly, final assembly and functional test integrated into the production flow.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve consumer programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Consumer electronics programs are supported by Koh Kong in Cambodia, Jiaxing in China and Lamphun in Thailand, with capabilities spanning high-volume SMT, EMS, PCBA, LED assembly and box build.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana do the miniaturized, dense assembly modern devices need?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana supports compact, high-density electronics through fine-pitch SMT, miniaturized sensor assembly and broader microelectronics manufacturing capabilities.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a consumer electronics build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your product, manufacturing requirements and expected volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site and process route for your program.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>